// The BF16 GEMMs' second operand (STRATA_PREFILL_BF16X2): what the BF16 image `hi` left out of f, itself in BF16.
// W.hi + W.lo carries ~16 mantissa bits of the activation - the decode path's FP32 x to within ~1e-5.
